        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>수력, 태양에너지를 이용해 탄소 배출량을 줄일 수 있다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
