    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="14" id="PRB-D9266551773E9ACD-Q14">
      <question_stem>에틸렌 1 mol이 완전연소될 경우, 부피 기준 공연비(AFR)는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>부피 기준 공연비(AFR)</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>1.4 × 10</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 환경공학개론 · 공연비
정답은 ③이다. C₂H₄ + 3O₂ → 2CO₂ + 2H₂O이므로 에틸렌 1 mol에 산소 3 mol이 필요하다. 공기량 = 3 ÷ 0.21 ≒ 14.3 mol이므로 부피 기준 공연비 = 14.3 ÷ 1 ≒ 1.4 × 10이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3.0</choice_text>
          <commentary>산소량이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>9.5</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>1.4 × 10</choice_text>
          <commentary>1.4 × 10이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2.4 × 10</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2024년 · 제1회 지방직공무원 시험 | 제1회 지방직공무원 시험(시도교육청))</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="15" id="PRB-D9266551773E9ACD-Q15">
      <question_stem>수소 분자가 10 wt%, 수분이 15 wt% 함유된 도시 폐기물의 고위발열량이 3600 kcal/kg일 때, Dulong식을 사용하여 계산한 저위발열량[kcal/kg]은? (단, 온도는 일정하고, 물의 증발열은 600 kcal/kg이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>수소</keyword>
        <keyword>분자</keyword>
        <keyword>수분</keyword>
        <keyword>함유된</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>2970</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 환경공학개론 · 저위발열량
정답은 ③이다. Dulong식에 따르면 저위발열량 Hl = Hh - 600(9H + W)이다. Hl = 3,600 - 600 × (9 × 0.10 + 0.15) = 3,600 - 600 × 1.05 = 3,600 - 630 = 2,970 kcal/kg이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2730</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2850</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>2970</choice_text>
          <commentary>2,970 kcal/kg이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3150</choice_text>
          <commentary>수분만 반영한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
